      "author": "Tim Paul",
      "notes": "Initially designed to test the 'Sound group' feature. Notes are played from one of 3 chords: Dm7, G7 or Cmaj7. Note sequence timings are based on the Fibonnaci sequence. Each time a note sequence ends there's a 1-in-3 chance that track will switch to a new chord. The track is named after the Indian scholar who described the sequence, 1,400 years before Fibonnaci.",
